    "l0_content": "A technical overview of microarchitecture in computer engineering, detailing its relationship to instruction set architecture (ISA), key design aspects like pipelining and execution units, and advanced concepts such as caching, branch prediction, superscalar processing, out-of-order execution, and multithreading.",
